        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Sections: In a section or subsection, that opening segment may be just a paragraph; in longer sections, it will be proportionally longer. Even so, at its end it expresses the section's point and introduces the key concepts that follow. There is not enough space here to illustrate how that principle applies to a passage several paragraphs long, but it is easy to imagine.",
