            "block_content": "Whole documents: In a whole document, that opening segment is typically called the introduction, and it may be one or more paragraphs long, perhaps even a few pages. Even so, it should be substantially shorter than the rest, and in a sentence at its end, it should state the point of the whole document and introduce its key concepts.",
